      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Fibo 2.0 Edit Turbo: editing in 4 steps\n\n**Edit Turbo** is step- and guidance-distilled from Dev for editing: 4 steps, CFG 1, no negative pass. Give it the\nsource image as **Reference 1** and say what changes and what stays. Without references it renders text-to-image too\n(community-verified).\n\n**Settings**: 4 steps, CFG 1 (distilled; higher CFG doubles the compute and burns the image), euler, simple. A single\nreference is resized to Width × Height: set the size to the aspect of the source, about 1 MP, sides multiples of 16\n(Width and Height 0 in the graph take it from the first reference). The negative output of Text Encode Fibo 2 is\nunused at CFG 1, so it is not marked and the Generate tab shows no negative prompt.\n\n**Edit prompts**: address the references as `<image_1>`, `<image_2>`, ... in input order (source first, up to 4).\nVague instructions restyle the whole image; name what stays (\"keep the face, pose and background unchanged\").\n- Instruction edit: \"Replace the jacket with a red leather jacket, keep the person, pose and background unchanged\"\n- Multi-reference: \"Dress the person in <image_1> in the dress from <image_2>\"\n- Product integration: \"Place the bottle from <image_2> on the kitchen counter in <image_1>, matching the scene's lighting\"\n- Text edit: \"Change the shop sign text to 'OPEN LATE', same font and colors\"\n- Relighting: \"Change the time of day to sunset with warm low light from the right, keep everything else unchanged\"\n\n## Image Bench\n\n| Marker | Node | Generate tab |\n|--------|------|--------------|\n| `ib:cp` | Load Diffusion Model | model list, model exploration |\n| `ib:pp` | Image Bench Prompt | prompt and LoRA list |\n| `ib:smp` | KSampler | seed, steps, CFG scale, sampling method, schedule type; size (Width / Height) |\n| `ib:ref:0-3` | Reference 1-4 (bypassed) | References panel |\n| `ib:lora` | Load LoRA (bypassed) | LoRA exploration only |\n\n**References**: add images in the References panel of the Generate tab, by \"Ps sends to: reference\" from the\neditor, or by dropping them there. Text Encode Fibo 2 shows them to the Qwen3-VL encoder and appends their VAE\nlatents to the sequence. An empty slot is bypassed, which leaves its encoder input unconnected. Each reference adds\nabout a full image of tokens, so time and VRAM grow with every one.\n\nEdit Turbo is not meant for LoRAs or fine-tuning (they target Dev); the LoRA list still applies them.\n\nThere is no masked edit in the core node: describe the region in the instruction, or use the inpaint workflow.\n\nFibo 2.0 needs a ComfyUI with the **TextEncodeFibo2** node (master after 21 Oct 2026, PR #17240; v0.42.3\nand older lack it). The CLIP loader type must be `fibo2`. Use the bf16 text encoder: the int8 one fails with `NoCapableBackendError ... dequantize_int8_embedding`\non image input.\n\n## Model Links\n\n[Comfy-Org/Fibo-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Fibo-2.0) (ungated repack of [briaai/Fibo-2.0-dev](https://huggingface.co/briaai/Fibo-2.0-dev) and\n[briaai/Fibo-2.0-edit-turbo](https://huggingface.co/briaai/Fibo-2.0-edit-turbo)) also has the `*_bf16` diffusion models (16.45 GB) and the\n`qwen3vl_4b_int8_convrot` text encoder (text-to-image only: it errors on image input).\n\n**diffusion_models**: [fibo2_dev_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Fibo-2.0/resolve/main/diffusion_models/fibo2_dev_int8_convrot.safetensors), [fibo2_edit_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Fibo-2.0/resolve/main/diffusion_models/fibo2_edit_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n**text_encoders**: [qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Fibo-2.0/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors) (one file for Dev and Edit Turbo)\n**vae**: [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Fibo-2.0/resolve/main/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors) (the FLUX.2 VAE)\n\nFibo 2.0 is released under CC BY-NC 4.0 (non-commercial; commercial use needs an agreement with Bria).\n"
      ],
      "title": "Note: Fibo 2.0 Edit Turbo (references)",
